{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/__ROAD_MAP_FINAL.jpg?t=1747060961\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the battlefield with Warside, a modern iteration on the classic turn-based-tactics formula. Experience an <strong>epic story mode campaign</strong>. Choose between <strong>legendary Commanders</strong>, each with unique playstyles and devastating <strong>Battle Powers</strong>. Master the battlefield with a vast array of terrain and units. All brought to life with <strong>beautiful pixel art</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your Commander, assemble your forces, and battle your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Over 30 Unit Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Storm the battlefield with <strong>tanks</strong> and <strong>artillery</strong>. Master the seas with  <strong>submarines</strong> and  <strong>warships</strong>. Conquer the skies with <strong>helicopters</strong> and <strong>jet aircraft</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/Units.gif?t=1747060961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command a variety of specialist infantry, including <strong>snipers</strong>, <strong>medics</strong>, <strong>mortar teams</strong>, and <strong>saboteurs</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">14 Playable Commanders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 14 Commanders, each with <strong>unique passive skills</strong> and game-changing <strong>Battle Powers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/BattlePowers.gif?t=1747060961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Powers can be devastating, but they need careful timing to have the most impact. Choose wisely for maximum effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills in our epic single-player campaign with <strong>over 30 missions</strong> to master. Classic battles, plus escort, rescue, and covert missions with jaw-dropping story events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/GameScene1.png?t=1747060961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle in beautifully drawn <strong>forest</strong>, <strong>desert</strong>, and <strong>ice</strong> environments, plus the <strong>toxic wastelands</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge friends and enemies to thrilling <strong>multiplayer</strong> battles in <strong>online play</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/Multiplayer.png?t=1747060961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive <strong>turn-based gameplay</strong> with a familiar feel for fans of the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>14 playable Commanders</strong>, each with unique <strong>passive skills</strong> and <strong>Battle Powers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control <strong>30+ unit types</strong>. Simultaneously battle over land, air, and sea with <strong>ground forces</strong>, <strong>aircraft</strong>, and <strong>naval units</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faction unique units</strong> with mechanics specific to each faction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-player campaign</strong> with over 30 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forest</strong>, <strong>desert</strong> and <strong>snow</strong> environments, plus the <strong>toxic wastelands</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge friends and foes with <strong>multiplayer battles</strong>. Local and internet play are supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own maps with the <strong>built-in mission editor</strong> for both single and multiplayer.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2368300?t=1747060961","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/c2e44f84c06378cd86bd29b7da1496067630d394/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747060961","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/b99da9dc07af49c098cdd624efd419292d49e6b3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747060961","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/b99da9dc07af49c098cdd624efd419292d49e6b3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747060961","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/__ROAD_MAP_FINAL.jpg?t=1747060961\" /><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the battlefield with Warside, a modern iteration on the classic turn-based-tactics formula. Experience an <strong>epic story mode campaign</strong>. Choose between <strong>legendary Commanders</strong>, each with unique playstyles and devastating <strong>Battle Powers</strong>. Master the battlefield with a vast array of terrain and units. All brought to life with <strong>beautiful pixel art</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your Commander, assemble your forces, and battle your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Over 30 Unit Types</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Storm the battlefield with <strong>tanks</strong> and <strong>artillery</strong>. Master the seas with  <strong>submarines</strong> and  <strong>warships</strong>. Conquer the skies with <strong>helicopters</strong> and <strong>jet aircraft</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/Units.gif?t=1747060961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command a variety of specialist infantry, including <strong>snipers</strong>, <strong>medics</strong>, <strong>mortar teams</strong>, and <strong>saboteurs</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">14 Playable Commanders</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from 14 Commanders, each with <strong>unique passive skills</strong> and game-changing <strong>Battle Powers</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/BattlePowers.gif?t=1747060961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle Powers can be devastating, but they need careful timing to have the most impact. Choose wisely for maximum effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test your skills in our epic single-player campaign with <strong>over 30 missions</strong> to master. Classic battles, plus escort, rescue, and covert missions with jaw-dropping story events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/GameScene1.png?t=1747060961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle in beautifully drawn <strong>forest</strong>, <strong>desert</strong>, and <strong>ice</strong> environments, plus the <strong>toxic wastelands</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge friends and enemies to thrilling <strong>multiplayer</strong> battles in <strong>online play</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/extras/Multiplayer.png?t=1747060961\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Highlights</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Intuitive <strong>turn-based gameplay</strong> with a familiar feel for fans of the classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>14 playable Commanders</strong>, each with unique <strong>passive skills</strong> and <strong>Battle Powers</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Control <strong>30+ unit types</strong>. Simultaneously battle over land, air, and sea with <strong>ground forces</strong>, <strong>aircraft</strong>, and <strong>naval units</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Faction unique units</strong> with mechanics specific to each faction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-player campaign</strong> with over 30 missions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forest</strong>, <strong>desert</strong> and <strong>snow</strong> environments, plus the <strong>toxic wastelands</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge friends and foes with <strong>multiplayer battles</strong>. Local and internet play are supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own maps with the <strong>built-in mission editor</strong> for both single and multiplayer.</p></li></ul>","developers":["LAVABIRD"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2368300/d3ca48b32d06d648a009f1ba8ac458410ae7f124/header.jpg?t=1747060961","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 LAVABIRD Ltd 2022.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or equivalent (6th Gen)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible video card</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or equivalent (9th Gen)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible video card</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257138587,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138587/movie480.mp4?t=1747060959","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138587/movie_max.mp4?t=1747060959"},"name":"Roadmap to 2.0","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257138587/583fc5a9fbe701a9fbe07b469debaf14c8b011f7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747060959","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257138587/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747060959","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com